    "sections": {
        "description": "The Lawyer Consultant Firm theme is a professional, elegant, and fully responsive solution designed for law firms, legal consultants, attorneys, advocates, corporate lawyers, law advisors, legal service providers, and consultancy agencies. Ideal for legal website templates, attorney layouts, law firm portals, consultancy agency sites, corporate law pages, and legal service showcases, this theme features a clean, modern, and user-friendly design that ensures an engaging experience across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. It includes dedicated sections for service listings, case studies, client testimonials, team profiles, and strategically placed call-to-action buttons to attract and convert potential clients. Built with secure, optimized, and SEO-friendly code, the theme allows easy customization of colors, fonts, layouts, and sections to match your firm’s brand identity. Fully compatible with WooCommerce for service bookings or payments and Contact Form 7 for client inquiries, Lawyer Consultant Firm provides a high-performing, professional platform to showcase legal expertise, build credibility, and grow your practice online."
    },
